th</option><option>South</option><option>East</option><option>West</option></select></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Architecture style</label><select name="style" class="form-select"><option value="">AI decide from brief</option><option>Modern Tropical</option><option>Contemporary</option><option>Luxury</option><option>Minimalist</option><option>Courtyard</option><option>African Tropical</option></select></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Your brief *</label><textarea name="brief" class="form-control" required placeholder="Describe the people, spaces, privacy, outdoor areas, parking, views, light, style and anything else that matters."></textarea></div><div class="col-12 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 flex-wrap"><div class="note">AI will keep explicit bedroom counts and courtyard requirements as hard constraints.</div><button class="btn btn-main" type="submit"><span class="btn-text">Generate architectural concept</span><span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm d-none"></span></button></div></div></form></div></div></div></section>
