<section class="section dark-section" id="method"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5"><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="section-label text-success mb-3">03 — Human + AI workflow</div><h2 class="display-5">AI proposes. You direct. The model updates.</h2><p class="lead-copy" style="color:#bac2b8">The goal is not to lock you into an AI answer. You should be able to change rooms, dimensions and positions, then see the same edited model in 3D.</p></div><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="method-line"><small>01</small><h4>AI generates</h4><div class="text-white-50">A constrained spatial concept from your brief and plot.</div></div><div class="method-line"><small>02</small><h4>Human edits</h4><div class="text-white-50">Select a room, rename it, change dimensions or drag it to a new position.</div></div><div class="method-line"><small>03</small><h4>Model stays synchronized</h4><div class="text-white-50">The edited 2D plan becomes the source for the 3D visualization.</div></div><div class="method-line"><small>04</small><h4>Iterate</h4><div class="text-white-50">Ask AI for another proposal without losing the human-edited direction.</div></div></div></div></div></section>
